OL,3,ASri Lanka's ex-first lady arrested over
OL,4,Aalleged misuse of children's hospital
OL,5,Adonations
OL,6,
OL,7,FSri Lanka's former first lady Shiranthi
OL,8,FRajapaksa has been arrested over
OL,9,Fallegations that a charity she is
OL,10,Flinked to misused donations raised for
OL,11,Fa children's hospital.
OL,13,FAnti-corruption authorities arrested
OL,14,Fthe 73-year-old wife of former
OL,15,FPresident Mahinda Rajapaksa at their
OL,16,FColombo home on Wednesday.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
