OL,3,ASri Lanka's ex-first lady arrested over
OL,4,Aalleged misuse of children's hospital
OL,5,Adonations
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey are questioning her over the 10
OL,8,Fmillion rupees ($30,300; #22,800) of
OL,9,Fdonations collected by the Siriliya
OL,10,FSaviya charity, meant to be spent on a
OL,11,Fspecialised scanner for Colombo's Lady
OL,12,FRidgeway Children's Hospital.
OL,14,FBut officials say such a scanner had
OL,15,Falready been donated by the Chinese
OL,16,Fgovernment.
